{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>\"I will stand before you there, upon the rock at Horev\"</b> — because the miracle of the water in this place was now permanently established, that the well would be with them all the days of the wilderness, according to the words of our Sages (Bemidbar Rabbah 19:25). For this reason the Shekhinah was revealed to him in that place, just as He said concerning the manna (Exodus 16:7), \"and in the morning you shall see the glory of YHWH\" — because it was an ongoing miracle."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:09:44.644967447Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}